#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.2.0"
msgstr "v1.2.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.2.0 is a foundational, very large release that builds out most of the "
"classic OpenMV imaging API: the **drawing** methods, **binary / morphology**"
" operations, **keypoint descriptors** (FAST / FREAK / LBP), **color "
"conversions** and :class:`image.statistics`, **BMP / PPM / JPEG** file I/O, "
"the ``lcd``, :mod:`mjpeg`, :mod:`gif`, and ``mlx`` thermal modules, the "
"**OV7725** camera, and many :mod:`sensor` controls. Some core :mod:`sensor` "
"behavior changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v1.2.0 je temeljno, vrlo veliko izdanje koje izgrađuje većinu klasičnog "
"OpenMV API-ja za obradu slike: metode za **crtanje**\\ , **binarne / "
"morfološke** operacije, **deskriptore ključnih točaka** (FAST / FREAK / "
"LBP), **konverzije boja** i :class:`image.statistics`\\ , **BMP / PPM / "
"JPEG** ulaz/izlaz datoteka, module ``lcd``\\ , :mod:`mjpeg`\\ , :mod:`gif` i"
" ``mlx`` toplinski modul, **OV7725** kameru te brojne kontrole modula "
":mod:`sensor`\\ . Promijenjeno je neko temeljno ponašanje modula "
":mod:`sensor` — pročitajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost u "
"nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Drawing API** — ``draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / ``draw_circle()``"
" / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / ``draw_keypoints()``."
msgstr ""
"**API za crtanje** — ``draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / "
"``draw_circle()`` / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Binary / morphology** — ``binary()``, ``invert()``, ``and/or/xor/...``, "
"``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` / ``morph()``, ``negate()`` / ``difference()``."
msgstr ""
"**Binarne / morfološke operacije** — ``binary()``\\ , ``invert()``\\ , "
"``and/or/xor/...``\\ , ``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` / ``morph()``\\ , "
"``negate()`` / ``difference()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Keypoints** — FAST / FREAK / LBP descriptors with ``match_descriptor()`` /"
" ``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()``."
msgstr ""
"**Ključne točke** — FAST / FREAK / LBP deskriptori s ``match_descriptor()`` "
"/ ``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**New modules** — ``lcd``, :mod:`mjpeg`, :mod:`gif` (color), and ``mlx`` "
"thermal."
msgstr ""
"**Novi moduli** — ``lcd``\\ , :mod:`mjpeg`\\ , :mod:`gif` (u boji) i ``mlx``"
" toplinski."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"**OV7725** camera support; :class:`image.statistics`; BMP/PPM/JPEG file I/O."
msgstr ""
"Podrška za **OV7725** kameru; :class:`image.statistics`\\ ; BMP/PPM/JPEG "
"ulaz/izlaz datoteka."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** :func:`sensor.reset`, :func:`sensor.snapshot`, and "
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` behavior changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** ponašanje funkcija :func:`sensor.reset`\\ , "
":func:`sensor.snapshot` i :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` je promijenjeno — "
"pogledajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:35
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Drawing** — added ``image.draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / "
"``draw_circle()`` / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` with keyword arguments (color, thickness, …)."
msgstr ""
"**Crtanje** — dodane su ``image.draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / "
"``draw_circle()`` / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` s ključnim argumentima (boja, debljina, …)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Binary / morphology** — added ``image.binary()``, ``invert()``, ``and()`` "
"/ ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / ``xor()`` / ``xnor()``, ``erode()`` / "
"``dilate()`` / ``morph()``, ``negate()`` / ``difference()``, ``pixels()``, "
"``centroid()``, ``orientation_radians()`` / ``orientation_degrees()``, and "
"``width()`` / ``height()`` / ``format()``."
msgstr ""
"**Binarne / morfološke operacije** — dodane su ``image.binary()``\\ , "
"``invert()``\\ , ``and()`` / ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / ``xor()`` /"
" ``xnor()``\\ , ``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` / ``morph()``\\ , ``negate()`` / "
"``difference()``\\ , ``pixels()``\\ , ``centroid()``\\ , "
"``orientation_radians()`` / ``orientation_degrees()`` te ``width()`` / "
"``height()`` / ``format()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Keypoints / descriptors** — FAST keypoint extraction via "
"``find_keypoints()``, a unified ``match_descriptor()`` and "
"``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()`` for FREAK / LBP, plus a "
"profile-face Haar/LBP cascade."
msgstr ""
"**Ključne točke / deskriptori** — izdvajanje FAST ključnih točaka putem "
"``find_keypoints()``\\ , jedinstveni ``match_descriptor()`` i "
"``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()`` za FREAK / LBP, uz Haar/LBP "
"kaskadu za profil lica."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Color / statistics** — :class:`image.statistics` and color-conversion "
"functions (``rgb_to_lab`` / ``lab_to_rgb`` / ``rgb_to_grayscale`` / "
"``grayscale_to_rgb``)."
msgstr ""
"**Boja / statistika** — :class:`image.statistics` i funkcije za konverziju "
"boja (\\ ``rgb_to_lab`` / ``lab_to_rgb`` / ``rgb_to_grayscale`` / "
"``grayscale_to_rgb``\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:52
msgid ""
"**File I/O** — BMP / PPM (P2/P3/P5/P6) / JPEG load and save (including "
"grayscale JPEG and 4:2:0 / 4:2:2 chroma subsampling)."
msgstr ""
"**Ulaz/izlaz datoteka** — učitavanje i spremanje BMP / PPM (P2/P3/P5/P6) / "
"JPEG (uključujući JPEG u sivim tonovima i 4:2:0 / 4:2:2 kromatsko "
"poduzorkovanje)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Modules** — new ``lcd`` (LCD shield), :mod:`mjpeg` (video recording), "
"color :mod:`gif` (with ``Gif.loop()``), and ``mlx`` thermal-camera modules, "
"each with example scripts."
msgstr ""
"**Moduli** — novi ``lcd`` (LCD štit), :mod:`mjpeg` (snimanje videa), "
":mod:`gif` u boji (s ``Gif.loop()``\\ ) i ``mlx`` modul za toplinsku kameru,"
" svaki s primjerima skripti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added :func:`sensor.get_id` (+ OV9650/OV2640/OV7725 PID "
"constants), :func:`sensor.set_special_effect` (SDE_* constants), "
"``sensor.set_image_filter()`` (FILTER_BW / FILTER_SKIN), the ``HQVGA`` "
"framesize, and ``image.set_pixel(x, y, …)``."
msgstr ""
"**Senzor** — dodani su :func:`sensor.get_id` (+ OV9650/OV2640/OV7725 PID "
"konstante), :func:`sensor.set_special_effect` (SDE_* konstante), "
"``sensor.set_image_filter()`` (FILTER_BW / FILTER_SKIN), veličina sličice "
"``HQVGA`` te ``image.set_pixel(x, y, …)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"**WiFi** — added the ATWINC1500 WiFi driver and OpenMV 1/2 BSP groundwork, "
"plus a BLE example."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi** — dodan je ATWINC1500 WiFi upravljački program i temelji za OpenMV "
"1/2 BSP, uz BLE primjer."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:65
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:67
msgid ""
"The framebuffer is now JPEG-compressed before streaming to OpenMV IDE (lower"
" bandwidth); JPEG compression is done in place; OV7725 H/V zoom enables "
"arbitrary scaling; improved (faster) Haar face detection that runs at QVGA."
msgstr ""
"Međuspremnik slike sada se JPEG-komprimira prije slanja u OpenMV IDE (manja "
"propusnost); JPEG kompresija se obavlja na licu mjesta; OV7725 H/V zumiranje"
" omogućuje proizvoljno skaliranje; poboljšana (brža) Haar detekcija lica "
"koja radi pri QVGA razlučivosti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:73
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:75
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "Obrada slike:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"Fixed the integral-image computation, ``median()`` filter corruption, the "
"centroid computation, RGB skin / black-and-white filters on RGB input, and "
"faster grayscale BMP/PPM read/write."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeni su izračun integralne slike, oštećenje ``median()`` filtra, "
"izračun centroida, RGB filtri za kožu / crno-bijelo na RGB ulazu te brže "
"čitanje/pisanje BMP/PPM datoteka u sivim tonovima."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:81
msgid "Sensor and system:"
msgstr "Senzor i sustav:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:83
msgid ""
"Fixed the :class:`pyb.Servo` timers (Servo now works), HQVGA resolution, SD-"
"card init reliability, re-initializing storage after a soft-reset, and re-"
"running the REPL when no script is present."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeni su mjerači vremena za :class:`pyb.Servo` (Servo sada radi), "
"HQVGA razlučivost, pouzdanost inicijalizacije SD kartice, ponovno "
"inicijaliziranje pohrane nakon mekog ponovnog pokretanja te ponovno "
"pokretanje REPL-a kada nema prisutne skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:88
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:90
msgid "**OV7725** camera sensor."
msgstr "**OV7725** senzor kamere."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"**LCD shield** (``lcd`` module), ``mlx`` thermal camera, and **ATWINC1500** "
"WiFi groundwork."
msgstr ""
"**LCD štit** (modul ``lcd``\\ ), ``mlx`` toplinska kamera i temelji za "
"**ATWINC1500** WiFi."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:95
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:97
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.1.0 and v1.2.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Promjene API-ja vidljive korisniku između v1.1.0 i v1.2.0. Opseg: Python "
"C-moduli u ``modules/`` i Python biblioteke u ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"All three breaking changes are *behavior* changes to core :mod:`sensor` "
"functions (same API, different behavior) — re-check affected scripts. Each "
"commit hash links to its diff on GitHub. (The vast majority of this release "
"is new API built out within the v1.1→v1.2 range and is therefore additive, "
"not breaking.)"
msgstr ""
"Sve tri promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost su promjene *ponašanja* "
"temeljnih funkcija modula :mod:`sensor` (isti API, drukčije ponašanje) — "
"ponovno provjerite pogođene skripte. Svaki hash commita povezan je sa svojim"
" diffom na GitHubu. (Velika većina ovog izdanja je novi API izgrađen unutar "
"raspona v1.1→v1.2 i stoga je dodatak, a ne narušavanje.)"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:109
msgid ":func:`sensor.reset` no longer applies a default config *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.reset` više ne primjenjuje zadanu konfiguraciju *(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:111
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.reset` no longer applies a built-in default configuration "
"(pixformat / framesize / framerate / gain / contrast / brightness / "
"saturation). Scripts that relied on ``reset()`` leaving a usable default "
"must now explicitly call :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` and "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` (and any other settings) after ``reset()``."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.reset` više ne primjenjuje ugrađenu zadanu konfiguraciju "
"(pixformat / framesize / framerate / gain / contrast / brightness / "
"saturation). Skripte koje su se oslanjale na to da ``reset()`` ostavlja "
"iskoristive zadane vrijednosti sada moraju eksplicitno pozvati "
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` i :func:`sensor.set_framesize` (te bilo koje "
"druge postavke) nakon ``reset()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d1e782df3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1e782df3>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `d1e782df3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1e782df3>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:122
msgid ":func:`sensor.snapshot` raises on timeout *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` izaziva iznimku pri isteku vremena *(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:124
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` now raises ``RuntimeError(\"Sensor Timeout!!\")`` "
"when the sensor times out instead of hanging indefinitely. Wrap "
"``snapshot()`` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` if you need to tolerate "
"timeouts."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` sada izaziva ``RuntimeError(\"Sensor Timeout!!\")`` "
"kada senzor istekne umjesto da se beskonačno zaglavi. Omotajte "
"``snapshot()`` u ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` ako trebate tolerirati "
"istek vremena."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:128
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `e3f41d674 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e3f41d674>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `e3f41d674 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e3f41d674>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:133
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` raises on unsupported format *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` izaziva iznimku za nepodržani format "
"*(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:135
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` now raises an exception when given an "
"unsupported pixel format instead of returning ``False``. Code that checked "
"the ``False`` return must catch the exception instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` sada izaziva iznimku kada dobije nepodržani "
"format piksela umjesto da vraća ``False``\\ . Kod koji je provjeravao "
"povratnu vrijednost ``False`` mora umjesto toga uhvatiti iznimku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:139
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `e0c5822c2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e0c5822c2>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `e0c5822c2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e0c5822c2>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:144
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolni popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:146
msgid "For a clean port to v1.2.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Za čisti prijenos na v1.2.0 tipičan posao je:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:148
msgid ""
"Explicitly set :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` / :func:`sensor.set_framesize` "
"after :func:`sensor.reset` (:ref:`the reset change <v1_2_0_reset>`)."
msgstr ""
"Eksplicitno postavite :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` / "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` nakon :func:`sensor.reset` (\\ :ref:`promjena "
"reseta <v1_2_0_reset>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:150
msgid ""
"Wrap :func:`sensor.snapshot` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` if you "
"need to tolerate sensor timeouts (:ref:`the snapshot change "
"<v1_2_0_snapshot>`)."
msgstr ""
"Omotajte :func:`sensor.snapshot` u ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` ako "
"trebate tolerirati istek vremena senzora (\\ :ref:`promjena snapshota "
"<v1_2_0_snapshot>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:153
msgid ""
"Catch the exception from :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` instead of checking "
"for ``False`` (:ref:`the set_pixformat change <v1_2_0_setpixformat>`)."
msgstr ""
"Uhvatite iznimku iz :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` umjesto provjere ``False`` "
"(\\ :ref:`promjena set_pixformat <v1_2_0_setpixformat>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:156
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
